IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sg-core`
IMPORT `sg-periods`
IMPORT `sgb2-s171-secretary`

-- Tests for s 171. Every expected value is written from the text, beside the assertion, before it was run.

§ `s 171(1): the secretaries every company must have`

-- A natural person with his or her principal or only residence in Singapore and not debarred under s 155B.
#ASSERT `s 171(1) the person is qualified to be a secretary of the company` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 171(1) the person is qualified to be a secretary of the company` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 171(1) the person is qualified to be a secretary of the company` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 171(1) the person is qualified to be a secretary of the company` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 171(1) the company has one or more secretaries` 1 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 171(1) the company has one or more secretaries` 3 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 171(1) the company has one or more secretaries` 0 EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- No period: done, FULFILLED; not done, RESIDUAL; the rule cannot reach BREACH.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 171(1) the company must have one or more secretaries each of whom is qualified` "Acme Pte Ltd" AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 171(1) have one or more secretaries each of whom is a natural person resident in Singapore and not debarred` AT 1

-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 171(1) the company must have one or more secretaries each of whom is qualified` "Acme Pte Ltd" AT 0 WITH

§ `s 171(1A), (1AA), (1AB): the directors' duties and the Registrar's power`

#ASSERT `s 171(1A) the directors have secured that each secretary appears to them to have the requisite knowledge and experience` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 171(1A) the directors have secured that each secretary appears to them to have the requisite knowledge and experience` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 171(1A) the directors must take all reasonable steps to secure that each secretary appears to them to have the requisite knowledge and experience` "Dana Tan" AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Director "Dana Tan" DOES `s 171(1A) take all reasonable steps to secure that each secretary appears to the directors to have the requisite knowledge and experience` AT 1

-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 171(1A) the directors must take all reasonable steps to secure that each secretary appears to them to have the requisite knowledge and experience` "Dana Tan" AT 0 WITH

-- (1AA): a public company: (a) or (b).
#ASSERT `s 171(1AA) the secretary of the public company is a person the directors must take all reasonable steps to secure` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 171(1AA) the secretary of the public company is a person the directors must take all reasonable steps to secure` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 171(1AA) the secretary of the public company is a person the directors must take all reasonable steps to secure` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- A private company: the duty of (1AA) is the duty of "the directors of a public company".
#ASSERT `s 171(1AA) the secretary of the public company is a person the directors must take all reasonable steps to secure` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 171(1AA) the directors of a public company must take all reasonable steps to secure that each secretary satisfies subsection (1AA)(a) or (b)` "Dana Tan" AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Director "Dana Tan" DOES `s 171(1AA) take all reasonable steps to secure that each secretary of the public company satisfies subsection (1AA)(a) or (b)` AT 1

-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 171(1AA) the directors of a public company must take all reasonable steps to secure that each secretary satisfies subsection (1AA)(a) or (b)` "Dana Tan" AT 0 WITH

-- (1AB): a power; a failed "if" gate answers NOTHING.
#ASSERT `s 171(1AB) the Registrar may require the private company to appoint as its secretary a person who satisfies subsection (1AA)(b)` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 171(1AB) the Registrar may require the private company to appoint as its secretary a person who satisfies subsection (1AA)(b)` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 171(1AB) the Registrar may require the private company to appoint as its secretary a person who satisfies subsection (1AA)(b)` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 171(1B), (1C), (1D): the declaration, the old secretary, and the word secretary`

-- (1B): at the time of the appointment: the day of the appointment, or before it. Filed late: not in time.
#ASSERT `s 171(1B) the person filed the declaration at the time of the appointment` (Date 1 6 2026) (Date 1 6 2026) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 171(1B) the person filed the declaration at the time of the appointment` (Date 1 6 2026) (Date 31 5 2026) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 171(1B) the person filed the declaration at the time of the appointment` (Date 1 6 2026) (Date 2 6 2026) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Not in the prescribed form, or not filed by the person or through a registered qualified individual authorised by the person.
#ASSERT `s 171(1B) the person filed the declaration at the time of the appointment` (Date 1 6 2026) (Date 1 6 2026) FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 171(1B) the person filed the declaration at the time of the appointment` (Date 1 6 2026) (Date 1 6 2026) TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 171(1B) the person appointed as a secretary must file the declaration with the Registrar at the time of the appointment` "Sam Lee" AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Individual "Sam Lee" DOES `s 171(1B) file with the Registrar a declaration that the person consents to act as secretary` AT 0

-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 171(1B) the person appointed as a secretary must file the declaration with the Registrar at the time of the appointment` "Sam Lee" AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Individual "Sam Lee" DOES `s 171(1B) file with the Registrar a declaration that the person consents to act as secretary` AT 1

-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 171(1B) the person appointed as a secretary must file the declaration with the Registrar at the time of the appointment` "Sam Lee" AT 0 WITH

-- (1C): a (1AA)(a) person who became a secretary of another company after 15 May 1987 and does not satisfy (1AA)(b).
#ASSERT `s 171(1C) the person is not to be regarded as qualified to discharge the functions of secretary under subsection (1A)` TRUE (Date 16 5 1987) FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 171(1C) the person is not to be regarded as qualified to discharge the functions of secretary under subsection (1A)` TRUE (Date 15 5 1987) FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 171(1C) the person is not to be regarded as qualified to discharge the functions of secretary under subsection (1A)` TRUE (Date 16 5 1987) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 171(1C) the person is not to be regarded as qualified to discharge the functions of secretary under subsection (1A)` FALSE (Date 16 5 1987) FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

#ASSERT `s 171(1D) the person is within the word secretary in the section and in sections 173 to 173I` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 171(1D) the person is within the word secretary in the section and in sections 173 to 173I` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 171(1D) the person is within the word secretary in the section and in sections 173 to 173I` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 171(1E): a sole director is not to act as secretary`

#ASSERT `s 171(1E) the person must not act or be appointed as the secretary of the company` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 171(1E) the person must not act or be appointed as the secretary of the company` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 171(1E) the sole director must not act or be appointed as the secretary of the company` "Dana Tan" TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Director "Dana Tan" DOES `s 171(1E) act or be appointed as the secretary of the company` AT 1

-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 171(1E) the sole director must not act or be appointed as the secretary of the company` "Dana Tan" FALSE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Director "Dana Tan" DOES `s 171(1E) act or be appointed as the secretary of the company` AT 1

-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 171(1E) the sole director must not act or be appointed as the secretary of the company` "Dana Tan" TRUE AT 0 WITH

§ `s 171(3) and (3A): appointed by the directors, and present at the registered office`

#ASSERT `s 171(3) the secretary or secretaries have been appointed by the directors` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 171(3) the secretary or secretaries have been appointed by the directors` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 171(3) at least one of the secretaries is present at the registered office as the subsection requires` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 171(3) at least one of the secretaries is present at the registered office as the subsection requires` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (3A): a private company whose secretary is readily contactable need not be physically present.
#ASSERT `s 171(3A) the secretary of the private company need not be physically present at the registered office` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 171(3A) the secretary of the private company need not be physically present at the registered office` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 171(3A) the secretary of the private company need not be physically present at the registered office` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Together: physical presence, or (3A).
#ASSERT `s 171(3) and (3A) the company has met the requirement of a secretary at the registered office` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 171(3) and (3A) the company has met the requirement of a secretary at the registered office` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 171(3) and (3A) the company has met the requirement of a secretary at the registered office` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 171(3) and (3A) the company has met the requirement of a secretary at the registered office` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 171(3) at least one secretary must be present at the registered office on the days and at the hours it is to be accessible to the public` "Sam Lee" AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Secretary "Sam Lee" DOES `s 171(3) be present at the registered office on the days and at the hours it is to be accessible to the public` AT 1

-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 171(3) at least one secretary must be present at the registered office on the days and at the hours it is to be accessible to the public` "Sam Lee" AT 0 WITH

§ `s 171(4), (4A) and (5): the vacancy, and director and secretary in one person`

#ASSERT `s 171(4) the thing may be done by or in relation to the person in place of the secretary` `s 171(4) an assistant or deputy secretary` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 171(4) the thing may be done by or in relation to the person in place of the secretary` `s 171(4) an assistant or deputy secretary` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 171(4) the thing may be done by or in relation to the person in place of the secretary` `s 171(4) an officer of the company authorised generally or specially in that behalf by the directors` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- An officer: only if there is no assistant or deputy secretary capable of acting, and the directors have authorised the officer.
#ASSERT `s 171(4) the thing may be done by or in relation to the person in place of the secretary` `s 171(4) an officer of the company authorised generally or specially in that behalf by the directors` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 171(4) the thing may be done by or in relation to the person in place of the secretary` `s 171(4) an officer of the company authorised generally or specially in that behalf by the directors` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 171(4) the thing may be done by or in relation to the person in place of the secretary` `s 171(4) an officer of the company authorised generally or specially in that behalf by the directors` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 171(4) the thing may be done by or in relation to the person in place of the secretary` `s 171(4) another person` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

-- (4A): vacant from 1 January 2026: 6 months after is 1 July 2026; 181 days.
#ASSERT `s 171(4A) the office of secretary was not left vacant for more than 6 months` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 1 7 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 171(4A) the office of secretary was not left vacant for more than 6 months` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 2 7 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Vacant from 31 August 2026: 6 months after is 28 February 2027 (a short month ends on its last day), also 181 days.
#ASSERT `s 171(4A) the office of secretary was not left vacant for more than 6 months` (Date 31 8 2026) (Date 28 2 2027) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 171(4A) the office of secretary was not left vacant for more than 6 months` (Date 31 8 2026) (Date 1 3 2027) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 171(4A) the number of days from the day the office became vacant to the last day of the 6 months` (Date 1 1 2026) EQUALS 181
#ASSERT `s 171(4A) the number of days from the day the office became vacant to the last day of the 6 months` (Date 31 8 2026) EQUALS 181

-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 171(4A) the company must not leave the office of secretary vacant for more than 6 months` "Acme Pte Ltd" 181 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 171(4A) fill the vacancy in the office of secretary` AT 181

-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 171(4A) the company must not leave the office of secretary vacant for more than 6 months` "Acme Pte Ltd" 181 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 171(4A) fill the vacancy in the office of secretary` AT 182

-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 171(4A) the company must not leave the office of secretary vacant for more than 6 months` "Acme Pte Ltd" 181 AT 0 WITH

#ASSERT `s 171(5) the thing done satisfies a provision requiring it to be done by or in relation to a director and the secretary` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 171(5) the thing done satisfies a provision requiring it to be done by or in relation to a director and the secretary` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
